      "created": 1793537326838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If first time pawn move and it is right next to opponent's\npawn(left or right). Then opponent can capture it\ndiagonally. \nIt stops opponent to pass directly pass through. ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If first time pawn move and it is right next to opponent's pawn(left or right). Then opponent can capture it diagonally. \nIt stops opponent to pass directly pass through. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
